---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pest Library | Identify Common Pests in Ontario | Zero Pest Control"
description: "Browse our pest library to identify common ants, cockroaches, wasps, rodents, and more found in Sudbury and Northern Ontario homes and businesses."
permalink: /pest-library/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Pest Library</p>
    <h1>Identify Common Pests in Ontario</h1>
    <p class="lede">Browse our pest library to quickly compare common insects and rodents found in Ontario homes and businesses.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="draft-notice reveal">
      {{ icon("alert-triangle") }}
      <span>[DRAFT &ndash; REVIEW] Every entry below was written to fill pages that had no content in the original site export. Please have a technician review each entry for accuracy before launch — see individual pages for details.</span>
    </div>

    {% set categories = collections.pestLibrary | groupby("data.category") %}
    {% for category, items in categories %}
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-top: {% if loop.first %}0{% else %}3rem{% endif %};">
      <h2>{{ category }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pest-grid">
      {% for item in items %}
      <a class="card pest-card reveal" href="{{ item.url }}">
        <div class="icon-badge">{{ icon(item.data.pestIcon) }}</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;">{{ item.data.commonName }}</h3>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Don't See Your Pest Listed?</h2>
        <p>We treat far more than what's listed here. Reach out and describe what you're seeing — we'll help identify it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-banner-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline-invert" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ icon("phone") }} Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
